	There are two files you might want to look at.  The FAQ
contains mostly info on downloading the game, and doesn't really have
much in the way of hints.  The Wheaton Spoiler File is chock full of
hints, possibly more than you really want.  E-mail me if you want a
copy.

	For a beginning player, I would recommend using a priest.
They have passable fighting and spellcasting, but more importantly
they help you become attuned to the highly important blessed/cursed
state of an item.  

	Eat fresh corpses.  I know it sounds gross, but you'll very
likely starve otherwise.  Some of them aren't healthy, though.  Trial
and error is really the only way to find out.  If your pet ate it, it
would have been ok for you too.

	Priest or not, use the #pray command iff you're in a life-
threatening situation.  The times I usually pray are when I am
fainting from starvation, sick from eating tainted meat, and low on
hit points, in that order.

	If you have any more problems, post about it and someone will
answer.

